3137,3257,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(361,481,\alpha&H00&)\t(3153,3273,\alpha&HFF&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(373,493,\alpha&H00&)\t(3170,3290,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(384,504,\alpha&H00&)\t(3186,3306,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(396,516,\alpha&H00&)\t(3203,3323,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(408,528,\alpha&H00&)\t(3220,3340,\alpha&HFF&)}s
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must return to my station. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, if I went back,\NI'd just be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Renly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that you are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:02:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broken. I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to punish you with deep
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,freeze despite the\Ndouble-winged blades choosing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you as their master you've\Nnever achieved perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapon control over them\Nas a knight. Good night,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are lacking something most crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Renly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her eminence made you good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a lucky boy you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fail...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does not matter whether I exist or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, this tent looks\Nlike it'll be safe enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll tuck him away in back and\Nstand guard at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not mean to startle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sir Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive our intrusion. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am at fault here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please, be at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am no longer a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a deserter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The unit I was assigned to\Ncommand must be in a panic by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sure some have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, I hide here in\Nsafety, like a filthy coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't introduced ourselves yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Ronie Arabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Tiese Streenin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the one behind her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Elite Disciple Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is the one who killed the Pontifex?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Knight, forgive me\Nif I'm being impertinent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but since you're here,\Ncould you please help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hate to ask, but you see, we gave our\Nword we'd keep Kirito safe no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still primary trainees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't defend ourselves\Nagainst things like goblins yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, we accepted this responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Alice is counting on us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's already here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they setting the tents on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a whole lot of this\Nweird-looking smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can see shapes moving around in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hookie here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found me some white-heeled girlies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win the\Ntournament today, Renly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,R-Ren, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So feisty, so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you come any closer, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you trying to protect these two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You struggle to Even though you cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stand Or speak Or draw your sword While I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.34,0:08:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ren Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to become a great knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And protect Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Renly, Integrity\NKnight, Renly Synthesis 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want my head, then be\Nready to give your lives for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chop him to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, the smoke should be\Nclearing from the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is hold out a\Nlittle longer and help will arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you their commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, i be kosugi, chief\Nof the mountain goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You done killed some of my best warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprised to find ye here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You being an integrity knight and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why ain't you be where the\Naction is with the other knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is none of your concern. Now perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought I was just another\Ngoblin, did you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I ain't so impressed\Nwith you either, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said before you were\Nan Integrity Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told one of you\Ncould take on a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that ain't the case\Nfor you now, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you've been\Nhiding all the way back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that you are broken, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are correct. I am not\Nmuch of a knight. Even so, let
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us be clear Though I might\Nbe defective these are not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this all day, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recollection!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit playing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ren-li-ji?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's gotten a bit more knightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were hoping to get\Ncredit for saving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad you had to spoil that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna care that we chopped\Noff way more heads than you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Knight, we humbly request your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep Kirito and the girls safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We handed them all off to\Nthe supply core just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should secure the area, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We killed all the goblins here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is the case, then I suppose\Nwe'd best return to our units. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
