Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Sigur Osig, Lord Shibori, and\NLord Kosogi have all been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Useless wretches!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demihumans can't be\Ncounted on for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you located all the\NIntegrity Knights yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Currently, we have the three on\Nthe front lines in our sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found two more among their rear units,\Nbut we do not have a fix on them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only five knights here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible, unless that\Nis all they ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless of how many there are\Nhere, we must slaughter them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, wake the minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have them fly for 700 mils, then\Ndescend upon the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And kill everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive the question, but won't our\Ndemi-human units get caught in that? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many minions do you wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have 800 available.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are all hatched and ready to go.
