Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle activated his\Nperfect weapon control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has made his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You imbecile! How did we not know they had\Nsuch a large unit of mages? They don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i i don't know what
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happened have they
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deployed their flying dragons yet no? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skies above the battlefield are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one dragon has been spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there can be only\None explanation for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be perfect weapon control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're knight's special skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using a weapon that way is risky, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would drain massive\Namounts of the knight's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they unleash such a barrage?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got word, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our spotter's located the\Ntwo knights in the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've targeted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now have all five\Nof them in our sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have waited for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my chance for glory,\Nand I shall seize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogre archers and dark mages, advance into\Nthe ravine. Once you are in position,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:18:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready the bows and begin the\Nincineration incantation.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&HF0EDEE&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.6\pos(963.513,873.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(2020,2140,\alpha&HFF&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(4,124,\alpha&H00&)\t(2029,2149,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(9,129,\alpha&H00&)\t(2038,2158,\alpha&HFF&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(14,134,\alpha&H00&)\t(2048,2168,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(18,138,\alpha&H00&)\t(2057,2177,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(23,143,\alpha&H00&)\t(2067,2187,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(28,148,\alpha&H00&)\t(2076,2196,\alpha&HFF&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(33,153,\alpha&H00&)\t(2086,2206,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(37,157,\alpha&H00&)\t(2095,2215,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(42,162,\alpha&H00&)\t(2105,2225,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(47,167,\alpha&H00&)\t(2114,2234,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(52,172,\alpha&H00&)\t(2124,2244,\alpha&HFF&)}R{\alpha&HFF&\t(56,176,\alpha&H00&)\t(2133,2253,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(61,181,\alpha&H00&)\t(2143,2263,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(66,186,\alpha&H00&)\t(2152,2272,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(71,191,\alpha&H00&)\t(2162,2282,\alpha&HFF&)}s{\alpha&HFF&\t(75,195,\alpha&H00&)\t(2171,2291,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(80,200,\alpha&H00&)\t(2181,2301,\alpha&HFF&)}D{\alpha&HFF&\t(85,205,\alpha&H00&)\t(2190,2310,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(90,210,\alpha&H00&)\t(2200,2320,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(94,214,\alpha&H00&)\t(2209,2329,\alpha&HFF&)}k {\alpha&HFF&\t(99,219,\alpha&H00&)\t(2218,2338,\alpha&HFF&)}T{\alpha&HFF&\t(104,224,\alpha&H00&)\t(2228,2348,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(108,228,\alpha&H00&)\t(2237,2357,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(113,233,\alpha&H00&)\t(2247,2367,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(118,238,\alpha&H00&)\t(2256,2376,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(123,243,\alpha&H00&)\t(2266,2386,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(127,247,\alpha&H00&)\t(2275,2395,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(132,252,\alpha&H00&)\t(2285,2405,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(137,257,\alpha&H00&)\t(2294,2414,\alpha&HFF&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(142,262,\alpha&H00&)\t(2304,2424,\alpha&HFF&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(146,266,\alpha&H00&)\t(2313,2433,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(151,271,\alpha&H00&)\t(2323,2443,\alpha&HFF&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(156,276,\alpha&H00&)\t(2332,2452,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(161,281,\alpha&H00&)\t(2342,2462,\alpha&HFF&)}- {\alpha&HFF&\t(165,285,\alpha&H00&)\t(2351,2471,\alpha&HFF&)}R{\alpha&HFF&\t(170,290,\alpha&H00&)\t(2361,2481,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(175,295,\alpha&H00&)\t(2370,2490,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(180,300,\alpha&H00&)\t(2380,2500,\alpha&HFF&)}r
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mage unit, prepare for wide-range\Nincineration projectiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spotters begin the\Nincantation to guide the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,projectiles to the\Nintegrity Knights position
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogres prepare to fire
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that the souls of the fallen\Nbelow, whether human or demi-human,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,generate sacred power\Nthat is so warm and pure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people of the human empire and the\Nmonsters of the dark territory have,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,essentially, the same souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only difference is\Nwhether they were born
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on one side of the End\NMountains or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, then why are they...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why are we fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, if you were here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I raised my sword against the\NPontifex and defied the Axiom Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my duty to see this through now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as maintaining elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am no match for what thousands\Nof dark mages are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And converting sacred power into\Nfire or ice elements would not be a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,potent enough art to sap all the spatial\Nresources rising from the ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, sealing luminous elements inside\Na mirror would reflect them infinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate thermal element!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.78,0:20:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate thermal element!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not working. What's\Ngoing on? What do we do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't activate the projectiles\Nwithout thermal elements!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, why isn't the incantation\Nworking, Archmage? If I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may i think all the spatial\Nresources have been depleted!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you insane that's impossible\Nwhat about all the screaming scores of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both humans and demi-humans have died\Nalready if those resources aren't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.48,0:21:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then where do they all go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The burden of taking countless lives for\Nthe sake of one shall be mine to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloom! Flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First element.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.24,0:22:10.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&HF9FEFE&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:22:10.76,0:22:13.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}"I'll be fine even if you're gone"
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.77,0:22:17.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5\c&H241B10&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.89,0:22:21.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&HFAFAFA&}An empty assurance escapes my lips again
Dialogue: 4,0:22:22.93,0:22:23.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.5}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.36,0:22:30.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)\blur0.5\c&H372317&}Memories swirl within me of the days we spent together
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.78,0:22:35.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H342517&}So bright that they hurt to look at now
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.59,0:22:43.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H45443F&\t(5338,5963,\c&H635253&)}If I was capable of living life all alone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.79,0:22:51.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur0.5\c&H23241A&}I never would have loved in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
